            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An earthen dish? (शरावः, śarāvaḥ.) A pitcher? (कुम्भः, kumbhaḥ.) A mortar? (उलूखलम्, ulūkhalam.) A pestle? (मुसलम्, musalam.) A sieve? (चालनी, cālanī.) A necklace? (हारः, hāraḥ.) A crown? (मुकुटम्, mukuṭam.) A lower garment? (अधोवस्त्रम्, adhovastram.) Clothing? (परिधानम्, paridhānam.) A garment? (वसनम्, vasanam.) A purchase? (क्रयः, krayaḥ.) A sale? (विक्रयः, vikrayaḥ.) An object? (वस्तु, vastu.) An item? (पदार्थः, padārthaḥ.) A tool? (उपकरणम्, upakaraṇam.)"
